          %p We then have the following.
          %p
          .num_prop
            %h6 Proposition
            %p
              Mackey functors form a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/reflective+subcategory"} reflective subcategory
              of semi-Mackey functors.
          %p
            This follows formally from the fact that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+completion"} group completion
            functor
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
